{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "0b6e618d9e15a4639cf8093c1d063d8e7d6d8ef214b7dbceb9e5d6e612036988", "ja": "何度だって、誰だって！！", "zh": "无论多少次，无论任何人！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b2e40723b34aed711db0958fdd6907aff2ccba3f3443653dc471abad1943a369", "ja": "チアライブ最終日は全員一丸となり大成功。\n数日後、例の女の子からメールが届く。結果\nは残念だったものの、新しい恋を見つけたと\nの事。女の子や、他にも応援を待つ人々のた\nめ、4人は気合いを入れ直すのだった。", "zh": "应援演出的最后一天，所有人团结一心，取得了圆满成功。\n几天后，收到了那位女孩发来的邮件。虽然结\n果令人遗憾，但她说自己找到了新的恋情。为了\n女孩，以及其他等待着加油的人们，4人重新振作了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "31c558645ec33ac76fd2a1c64ce21a4e37a4670e542a2d4610c8d1e4e19db4a1", "ja": "（チアライブ最終日！　駅前広場には、大勢の人達が\nチアを見に来ていた。今までで一番の盛り上がりだ！）", "zh": "（啦啦队Live的最后一天！车站前的广场上来了很多人看啦啦队表演。这是至今为止最热闹的一次！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "f4307131e94b19820b355d3eeff48209949a0ec3ef5ec82d9af5b64e7465b0c5", "ja": "みんなー！　楽しんでくれてますかー？\n元気、受け取ってくれてますかー！？", "zh": "大家——！玩得开心吗——？\n有精神地接收到我的心意了吗——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1002_tukou2", "source_sha256": "210c51888576d40e2e352ac6cc2e0d9f2e25ba7371811fd5c04c16c6b77830bd", "ja": "わあああっ！", "zh": "哇啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "d7c36c51cd209e425b20bb9dc16df6065e78f5881785376e1cf573b79a73febf", "ja": "朝からいい声出してくれて、サンキュな！\nその気合いで、今日も1日思いっきり行こうぜ！", "zh": "一大早就给我来这么好的声音，谢啦！\n带着这股劲，今天也全力冲1天吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "b63befb30c75780255232e8455337aa08022889fa46df05a2bc5c1ca0a9739b6", "ja": "うんうん！　みんなのスマイル～♪\n可奈の力になる～♪　みんなの力にもなる～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！大家的笑容～♪\n会成为可奈的力量～♪也会成为大家的力量～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "b5cb315b114f7def78d42ab39bcb070b12d91a47399f77252d75563720e227e6", "ja": "どんなに頑張っても、失敗しちゃう時はあるよね……。\nけど、そんな時は杏奈たちを思い出して！", "zh": "不管怎么努力，也总会有失败的时候吧……\n但是，这种时候就想想杏奈她们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "42d99900a1a2ff3c477361c10cca9688f00d2dbfc8ddd7772772dbc5652c8743", "ja": "みんながたくさん頑張ったこと……\n杏奈たち、思いっきり、ほめてあげちゃうからー！", "zh": "大家努力了那么多……\n杏奈会尽情夸奖大家的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1007_tukou2", "source_sha256": "c358090d8cc6b1d1243d457744d6eb10a39ebdb1b77e77ff9e561370a2d0ceb6", "ja": "わああああっ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1008_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "c9d3cdad2fded614ca4d63ceffa08a838027e2e6c8c1bc319ebed556fb2dc5c4", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nあの子からメールが来たって、本当ですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n那孩子发来邮件了，这是真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2dcc3c65ace2926673148a3d6de5557471edae6ac8fda1384fac0d5e91f80783", "ja": "ああ、今朝のメールの中にな。\n杏奈、読んでみるか？", "zh": "嗯，就在今天早上的邮件里。\n杏奈，你要读读看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "531b857fbdd7f89c179048fb4c3beed5fd3e830d37f3053df6a0b9d82df901e2", "ja": "……気になる……けど、\nちょっと、緊張する……かも……。", "zh": "……虽然很想知道……\n但好像……有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f5232b493752b2b57c6330a227faa4297b54f26a5fbcfcff921f9fc8e6474935", "ja": "待ち望んでたメールだもんな。\n春香、悪いけど読んでやってくれないか？", "zh": "毕竟是一直盼着的邮件啊。\n春香，不好意思，能替大家念一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "cced0ec8b154bc3119e06ce05d5681989a8a9d1cde82b942826175cd739457ab", "ja": "わかりました！　……「なかなかメールできなくて\nごめんなさい。先輩への告白の結果なんですが……」", "zh": "明白了！　……“一直没能给你发邮件，对不起。关于向前辈告白的结果……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "c85086e5651466436501fb6c95fecfa948e1b52ea4667d8e0229e62202528df1", "ja": "「『返事は少し待ってほしい』と言われて、数週間……\n結局、いいお返事はもらえませんでした……。」", "zh": "“对方说了‘希望再等等才能答复’之后过了几个星期……\n结果，还是没能得到好的答复……。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "8927819df2835345c44a06ea3739facf62b73ee484f86d44d84adae7caf48934", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。でも、勇気を出して\n告白したんだね。すごいね……！", "zh": "原来是这样啊……不过，你还是鼓起勇气\n告白了呢。真了不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "8d8c65252d37a724bb92f396b6c1aded582521308955ff69267cf0a1c57b3932", "ja": "うん……あれ？\nでもこのメール、まだ続きがありますね？", "zh": "嗯……咦？\n但这封邮件，后面好像还有呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "c9e30c014e6d84523a03e21387a4543c383bba2245fc5a72f0a3a9a6d4877a76", "ja": "「でも……私は、次の恋を見つけました！\n今度こそ、運命の相手だと思います！」……？", "zh": "“但是……我找到了下一段恋情！\n这次绝对是命中注定的对象！”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "fb368971556c860eca89343cd7549eb2448d97554cd1b04432cba825271a7d2a", "ja": "ええっ！？　すごい、\nもう次の恋を見つけられたんだね……！", "zh": "诶！？好厉害，已经找到下一段恋情了呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "82455b974350bd5d716cc260ee794f75b9e636e37bf59f33f55ea8f313a1b8c1", "ja": "ははっ。こんなに早く立ち直れるなんて、\nなかなか根性ある子だな！", "zh": "哈哈。能这么快就振作起来，看来是个相当有毅力的孩子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "153b98070b2f93a693f4ee8de57d6b75c32eaef9e8d12906cc57146c777842e1", "ja": "……次に……進んでるんだ……。\nそれなら、なにより……だね……。", "zh": "……正在……向前迈进……啊……  \n那样的话……就再好不过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "ae5ff0641457055b5d69491ebe4755bc13ff5d387e1ec1b4085982bc4947dade", "ja": "「最後に。私がすぐに立ち直れたのは、\n杏奈ちゃん達が、頑張った事をほめてくれたお陰です」", "zh": "“最后想说的是。我能够这么快重新振作起来，\n多亏了杏奈你们夸奖我努力付出的成果。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "c2aaf3e20479d269b11b6dc95c6b86fca295f548d32e606062bd4b430ff799db", "ja": "「私、頑張ります。また、応援してもらえますか？」\n……だとさ。応援届いてたぜ、アンナ！", "zh": "“我一定会努力的。大家以后还能继续为我加油吗？”\n……她是这么说的。你的心意已经传达到了哦，杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "559ccc25bd3d52e962be8c4961081b0f914520b36c09a9b4de8923d217875db0", "ja": "うん……！　もちろん、だよ……！\n杏奈、何度でも……頑張れって、伝える、よ……！", "zh": "嗯……！当然啦……！\n杏奈不管多少次……都会把“加油”传达给你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "8476c96897c0304d23023443b62703538d5f76600e8f60c76e498de2b9a6f492", "ja": "……あれ？　これって、私達宛てのメールですよね？\nなんだか、どんどん増えていってませんか？", "zh": "……咦？这是写给我们的邮件吧？\n总觉得邮件越来越多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "cfedb6fcebac3442adb9154f579777641bf454e24cf232cd73038fc0aed88644", "ja": "すごい数だな……\nみんな、4人の応援に励まされてくれたんだな。", "zh": "真是个惊人的数字啊……大家都受到了4人的支持和鼓励啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7ef70cbca428904414e54884fcc1b33e428b3154b478c68f2a29f7dc4f3cb3ca", "ja": "頑張る事は、ひとりでもできるけど……\n応援してもらうのは、ひとりじゃできないからな。", "zh": "努力这种事，一个人也能做到……但得到别人的支持，可不是一个人就能办到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "58a0a1952e6956041856e8076f5eb625340a1adafc85b1e93e6f0bcf1048d8f4", "ja": "今度は私たちが～、励ます番～♪\nみんなの応援～、倍々、倍返し～♪", "zh": "接下来轮到我们～鼓励大家啦～♪  \n把大家的加油～加倍加倍地回馈～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_06_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "0e0431360cd747b55c700a7af248b53041eb919752102477ac73d31817a057b5", "ja": "うん！　いつでも、どこにでも……\n杏奈たちの応援、ビビッと届けにいこうね！", "zh": "嗯！无论何时，无论去哪里……\n都要把杏奈她们的加油，元气满满地送到哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
